* =====================================================================
* lowswing_resonant.cir  --  THE CUBOID CORNER:
* LOW-SWING (partial-powering) x LC-RESONANT charge recovery in ONE
* ternary cell.  Does the V^2 wire saving AND the tank charge recovery
* COMPOSE, or does one lever's overhead dominate the other?
*
* Setup (fair-fight honesty rules, verbatim from ternary_adiabatic_fairfight.cir):
*   - Cell:      ternary_cell UNCHANGED (rwire=500, cline=1p, DIDEAL diode
*                receiver pair, rload=1Meg high-Z rails, cload=0.2p,
*                rterm=1Meg).
*   - Driver:    REAL half-bridge LC switches -- MPP (PMOS to +VLC rail),
*                MN0 (NMOS to 0 V, body at -VLC), MNN (NMOS to -VLC rail,
*                body at -VLC), each closed for T/2 = pi*sqrt(L*C) and
*                opened at the ring current zero-crossing.  Rbig+CAC
*                stabilize the near-zero-cap LC node (fairfight verbatim).
*   - Receiver:  REAL PMOS-input clocked sense amps (VDDSA=1.0 V LOCAL --
*                "power the receiver locally", same as lowswing_sweep.cir).
*   - Power-clock: the LC rails VLCP/VLCN are ideal DC supplies that
*                ACCEPT the return current (recovery is measured as a
*                NEGATIVE supply integral, fairfight convention).
*
* THE LOW-SWING LEVER: VLC dropped from +-0.6 V (line rings to +-1.04 V)
* to +-0.36 V (line ~ +-0.65 V) and +-0.28 V (line ~ +-0.5 V).
*   VLC=0.36 -> line ~ 0.66 V measured ("0.65 V swing" case)
*   VLC=0.28 -> line ~ 0.51 V measured ("0.5 V swing" case)
*
* THE VT WALL (honest): with the STOCK push drive (gate VLC<->0) the push
* PMOS has |Vgs| = VLC, so it is below threshold (|Vt|=0.4) below
* VLC~0.4 V -- the SAME device wall lowswing_sweep.cir found (FAIR driver
* dead below VDDR~0.5 V).  Case C0 demonstrates this death (line never
* swings, dA_push only ~42 mV, the cycle degenerates into one uncontrolled
* ring through the reset switch).  The reduced cases therefore use
* NEGATIVE GATE DRIVE on the push switch (gate VLCP<->VLCN, Vgs = -2*VLC),
* the same class of real-process fix the fairfight already applies to the
* pull switch (its off level is -0.6 V).
*
* Energy accounting (all measured, one window each):
*   E_drv   = INTEG V(pwpLC_k)  = -(V(vlcp_k)*I(VLCP_k)+V(vlcn_k)*I(VLCN_k))
*             over the phase window.  POSITIVE = delivered; NEGATIVE =
*             recovered to the power-clock (the reset phase).
*   E_cell  = INTEG V(inC_k)*I(VsC_k)  = energy into the cell at the
*             driver side (apples-to-apples with the old cell-only meas).
*   E_rec   = INTEG V(pwpSA) over the eval window (sense-amp supply,
*             both SAs; each eval sits in a GAP between phases so it does
*             not overlap a ring -- the rails hold their assert, tau=200ns).
*   E_trit_drv  = (E_push+E_pull+E_reset)/3      (fairfight convention)
*   E_trit_full = E_trit_drv + E_rec_avg         (lowswing convention,
*                 apples-to-apples with 0.092 pJ/bit which includes iface)
*   pJ/bit  = E_trit_full / log2(3) = /1.585
*   RESOLUTION: rail asserts rA_pk / rB_min + latch differentials
*             dA/dB at the demux time (mid-eval); null baseline ~+-4 mV
*             (lowswing measured); <10 mV or wrong sign = FAIL.
*   PEAK I  = supply current peak during push (I(VLCP)) and reset
*             (I(VLCN)); di/dt via ddt() probes.
*
* Cases (one full push+pull+reset cycle each, time-multiplexed):
*   REF : VLC=0.60 L=40u  -- full-swing reference (validate vs fairfight)
*   C0  : VLC=0.36 L=40u  -- STOCK push drive: driver-dead demonstration
*   A1-3: VLC=0.36 L=40/20/9.4u -- swing ~0.65 V, neg gate drive
*   B1-3: VLC=0.28 L=40/20/9.4u -- swing ~0.5 V, neg gate drive
*
* MEASURED (ngspice 44.2, E in pJ; per-trit = cycle/3; pJ/bit = /1.585):
*   REF:  push 0.862, pull ~0, reset -0.082 (RECOVERY) -> cycle 0.700
*   C0 :  push 0.000 (DEAD: |Vgs|=0.36 < |Vt|=0.4, line never swings)
*   A1 :  push 0.318, pull ~0, reset -0.093 (RECOVERY) -> cycle 0.221
*   A2 :  push 0.306, pull ~0, reset -0.011 (marginal) -> cycle 0.286
*   A3 :  push 0.276, pull ~0, reset +0.041 (DEAD, L too small) -> cycle 0.316
*   B1 :  push 0.192, pull ~0, reset -0.069 (RECOVERY) -> cycle 0.124
*   B2 :  push 0.187, pull ~0, reset -0.004 (marginal) -> cycle 0.184
*   B3 :  push 0.178, pull ~0, reset +0.010 (DEAD, L too small) -> cycle 0.191
*   DRIVER-ONLY per-trit (pJ/bit): REF 0.233 (0.147) | A1 0.074 (0.046)
*     A2 0.095 (0.060) | A3 0.105 (0.066) | B1 0.041 (0.026) | B2 0.061
*     (0.039) | B3 0.064 (0.040).  WITH receiver (2 SAs, ~0.05-0.10 pJ/trit):
*     A1 0.157 (0.099) | B1 0.128 (0.081)  [vs lowswing 0.145 (0.092);
*     vs full-swing LC 0.210-0.266 (0.133-0.168)]
*   RESOLUTION (mid-eval latch diff dA_push): REF +0.99 | A1 +0.86 | A2
*     +0.84 | A3 +0.83 | B1 +0.80 | B2 +0.80 | B3 +0.80  (OK >= 0.80,
*     vs ~+/-4 mV null baseline; C0 +0.03 = FAIL).  Rail asserts: REF 0.596
*     -> A1 0.336 -> B1 0.255 V (receiver resolves at all reduced swings).
*   NULL caveat (all swings, not low-swing-specific): the 1 M-ohm rails
*     hold their asserts for tau=200 ns, so the reset/null eval reads the
*     previous pull state unless rail equalization is added (fairfight
*     caveat (b), ~0.05 pJ).
*   CURRENT: peak push supply I: REF 95.5 -> A1 57.8 -> B1 44.4 uA (falls
*     ~proportional to swing); di/dt 0.17-0.30 A/us at every swing (vs
*     37-56 A/us fast lowswing driver, 376-1128 VTENG) -- low swing tames
*     the resonant current, does not worsen di/dt.
*   VERDICT: the V^2 lever and the charge-recovery lever COMPOSE on the
*     wire/tank (cycle 0.700 -> 0.124 pJ, better than V^2 scaling; reset
*     recovery is solid at L=40uH [-0.093/-0.069], marginal at 20uH
*     [-0.011/-0.004], dead at 9.4uH [+0.041/+0.010] -- the same L-wall
*     the full-swing fairfight hit, not a low-swing regression).  With
*     the receiver, the best cuboid corner is B1: 0.081 pJ/bit, 12%
*     below the lowswing-only 0.092 and 39% below the LC-only 0.133 --
*     but the fixed local receiver (0.08-0.10 pJ/trit) is now the
*     dominant term, capping the composition.
* =====================================================================

.options reltol=1e-3 abstol=1e-15 vntol=1e-6

* ---------- models (verbatim fairfight / binary_baseline) ----------
.model NMOS1 NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=0.4 KP=200u LAMBDA=0.05 TOX=2n)
.model PMOS1 PMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.4 KP=100u LAMBDA=0.05 TOX=2n)
.model DIDEAL D (IS=1e-14 RS=50 CJO=0.2p TT=2n N=1.0)

* ---------- cell (verbatim fairfight) ----------
.subckt ternary_cell in rA rB rwire=500 cline=1p rload=1meg cload=0.2p rterm=1meg
Rw in x {rwire}
Cx x 0 {cline}
Rterm x 0 {rterm}
D1 x rA DIDEAL
D2 rB x DIDEAL
RLA rA 0 {rload}
CLA rA 0 {cload}
RLB rB 0 {rload}
CLB rB 0 {cload}
.ends

* ---------- real receiver (verbatim fairfight sensamp) ----------
* out = high when inP < inM (PMOS conducts more on the lower input).
.subckt sensamp inP inM clk vddsa out outb
M1 out  inP cs cs PMOS1 W=1u  L=0.18u
M2 outb inM cs cs PMOS1 W=1u  L=0.18u
M5 cs   clk vddsa vddsa PMOS1 W=0.3u L=0.18u
M3 out  outb 0 0 NMOS1 W=0.5u L=0.18u
M4 outb out  0 0 NMOS1 W=0.5u L=0.18u
M6 out  clk  0 0 NMOS1 W=0.5u L=0.18u
M7 outb clk  0 0 NMOS1 W=0.5u L=0.18u
CLo  out  0 5f
CLob outb 0 5f
.ends

* ---------- shared receiver supply + probe ----------
VDDSA vddsa 0 DC 1.0
BpSA  pwpSA  0 V = -(V(vddsa)*I(VDDSA))

* ================= CASE REF: VLC=+-0.60 V, L=40.0u, T/2=20.71n (full-swing reference (fairfight case C clone)) =================
VLCP_ref vlcp_ref 0 DC 0.60
VLCN_ref vlcn_ref 0 DC -0.60
BpLC_ref pwpLC_ref 0 V = -(V(vlcp_ref)*I(VLCP_ref) + V(vlcn_ref)*I(VLCN_ref))
BdidtP_ref didtP_ref 0 V = -ddt(I(VLCP_ref))
BdidtN_ref didtN_ref 0 V =  ddt(I(VLCN_ref))
MPP_ref a_ref gPP_ref vlcp_ref vlcp_ref PMOS1 W=60u L=0.18u
VgPP_ref gPP_ref 0 PWL(0 0.60 100.00n 0.60 103.00n 0.00 123.71n 0.00 126.71n 0.60)
MN0_ref a_ref gN0_ref 0 vlcn_ref NMOS1 W=10u L=0.18u
VgN0_ref gN0_ref 0 PWL(0 -0.60 132.71n -0.60 135.71n 1.0 156.41n 1.0 159.41n -0.60)
MNN_ref a_ref gNN_ref vlcn_ref vlcn_ref NMOS1 W=10u L=0.18u
VgNN_ref gNN_ref 0 PWL(0 -0.60 165.41n -0.60 168.41n 0.40 189.12n 0.40 192.12n -0.60)
Rbig_ref a_ref 0 100meg
CAC_ref  a_ref 0 100f
L_ref a_ref d_ref 40.00u
Vs_ref d_ref in_ref DC 0
X_ref in_ref rA_ref rB_ref ternary_cell
BpC_ref pwC_ref 0 V = V(in_ref)*I(Vs_ref)
BpG_ref pwG_ref 0 V = V(gPP_ref)*I(VgPP_ref) + V(gN0_ref)*I(VgN0_ref) + V(gNN_ref)*I(VgNN_ref)
Vclk_ref clk_ref 0 PWL(0 1 128.21n 1 128.71n 0 130.71n 0 131.21n 1 160.91n 1 161.41n 0 163.41n 0 163.91n 1 193.62n 1 194.12n 0 196.12n 0 196.62n 1)
XsaA_ref 0 rA_ref clk_ref vddsa outA_ref outAb_ref sensamp
XsaB_ref rB_ref 0 clk_ref vddsa outB_ref outBb_ref sensamp
BdA_ref vdA_ref 0 V = V(outA_ref)-V(outAb_ref)
BdB_ref vdB_ref 0 V = V(outB_ref)-V(outBb_ref)

* --- measurements REF ---
.meas tran epush_ref_drv  INTEG V(pwpLC_ref) FROM=100.00n TO=126.71n
.meas tran epush_ref_cell INTEG V(pwC_ref)   FROM=100.00n TO=126.71n
.meas tran epush_ref_gate INTEG V(pwG_ref)   FROM=100.00n TO=126.71n
.meas tran epush_ref_rec  INTEG V(pwpSA) FROM=128.71n TO=133.71n
.meas tran epull_ref_drv  INTEG V(pwpLC_ref) FROM=132.71n TO=159.41n
.meas tran epull_ref_cell INTEG V(pwC_ref)   FROM=132.71n TO=159.41n
.meas tran epull_ref_gate INTEG V(pwG_ref)   FROM=132.71n TO=159.41n
.meas tran epull_ref_rec  INTEG V(pwpSA) FROM=161.41n TO=166.41n
.meas tran ereset_ref_drv  INTEG V(pwpLC_ref) FROM=165.41n TO=192.12n
.meas tran ereset_ref_cell INTEG V(pwC_ref)   FROM=165.41n TO=192.12n
.meas tran ereset_ref_gate INTEG V(pwG_ref)   FROM=165.41n TO=192.12n
.meas tran ereset_ref_rec  INTEG V(pwpSA) FROM=194.12n TO=199.12n
.meas tran ecyc_ref      INTEG V(pwpLC_ref) FROM=100.00n TO=192.12n
.meas tran line_ref_pk   MAX V(in_ref) FROM=100.00n TO=126.71n
.meas tran line_ref_min  MIN V(in_ref) FROM=132.71n TO=159.41n
.meas tran line_ref_end  FIND V(in_ref) AT=198.12n
.meas tran railA_ref_pk  MAX V(rA_ref) FROM=103.00n TO=126.71n
.meas tran railB_ref_min MIN V(rB_ref) FROM=135.71n TO=159.41n
.meas tran demA_push_ref FIND V(outA_ref) AT=129.71n
.meas tran demB_push_ref FIND V(outB_ref) AT=129.71n
.meas tran dA_push_ref   FIND V(vdA_ref)  AT=129.71n
.meas tran dB_push_ref   FIND V(vdB_ref)  AT=129.71n
.meas tran demA_pull_ref FIND V(outA_ref) AT=162.41n
.meas tran demB_pull_ref FIND V(outB_ref) AT=162.41n
.meas tran dA_pull_ref   FIND V(vdA_ref)  AT=162.41n
.meas tran dB_pull_ref   FIND V(vdB_ref)  AT=162.41n
.meas tran demA_reset_ref FIND V(outA_ref) AT=195.12n
.meas tran demB_reset_ref FIND V(outB_ref) AT=195.12n
.meas tran dA_reset_ref  FIND V(vdA_ref)  AT=195.12n
.meas tran dB_reset_ref  FIND V(vdB_ref)  AT=195.12n
.meas tran ipkP_ref MIN I(VLCP_ref) FROM=103.00n TO=126.71n
.meas tran ipkN_ref MAX I(VLCN_ref) FROM=168.41n TO=192.12n
.meas tran didtP_ref MAX V(didtP_ref) FROM=103.00n TO=126.71n
.meas tran didtN_ref MAX V(didtN_ref) FROM=168.41n TO=192.12n

* ================= CASE C0: VLC=+-0.36 V, L=40.0u, T/2=20.71n (stock push drive 0.36<->0: |Vgs|=0.36 < |Vt|=0.4 -> push PMOS below threshold (driver-dead demo)) =================
VLCP_c0 vlcp_c0 0 DC 0.36
VLCN_c0 vlcn_c0 0 DC -0.36
BpLC_c0 pwpLC_c0 0 V = -(V(vlcp_c0)*I(VLCP_c0) + V(vlcn_c0)*I(VLCN_c0))
BdidtP_c0 didtP_c0 0 V = -ddt(I(VLCP_c0))
BdidtN_c0 didtN_c0 0 V =  ddt(I(VLCN_c0))
MPP_c0 a_c0 gPP_c0 vlcp_c0 vlcp_c0 PMOS1 W=60u L=0.18u
VgPP_c0 gPP_c0 0 PWL(0 0.36 260.00n 0.36 263.00n 0.00 283.71n 0.00 286.71n 0.36)
MN0_c0 a_c0 gN0_c0 0 vlcn_c0 NMOS1 W=10u L=0.18u
VgN0_c0 gN0_c0 0 PWL(0 -0.36 292.71n -0.36 295.71n 1.0 316.41n 1.0 319.41n -0.36)
MNN_c0 a_c0 gNN_c0 vlcn_c0 vlcn_c0 NMOS1 W=10u L=0.18u
VgNN_c0 gNN_c0 0 PWL(0 -0.36 325.41n -0.36 328.41n 1.36 349.12n 1.36 352.12n -0.36)
Rbig_c0 a_c0 0 100meg
CAC_c0  a_c0 0 100f
L_c0 a_c0 d_c0 40.00u
Vs_c0 d_c0 in_c0 DC 0
X_c0 in_c0 rA_c0 rB_c0 ternary_cell
BpC_c0 pwC_c0 0 V = V(in_c0)*I(Vs_c0)
BpG_c0 pwG_c0 0 V = V(gPP_c0)*I(VgPP_c0) + V(gN0_c0)*I(VgN0_c0) + V(gNN_c0)*I(VgNN_c0)
Vclk_c0 clk_c0 0 PWL(0 1 288.21n 1 288.71n 0 290.71n 0 291.21n 1 320.91n 1 321.41n 0 323.41n 0 323.91n 1 353.62n 1 354.12n 0 356.12n 0 356.62n 1)
XsaA_c0 0 rA_c0 clk_c0 vddsa outA_c0 outAb_c0 sensamp
XsaB_c0 rB_c0 0 clk_c0 vddsa outB_c0 outBb_c0 sensamp
BdA_c0 vdA_c0 0 V = V(outA_c0)-V(outAb_c0)
BdB_c0 vdB_c0 0 V = V(outB_c0)-V(outBb_c0)

* --- measurements C0 ---
.meas tran epush_c0_drv  INTEG V(pwpLC_c0) FROM=260.00n TO=286.71n
.meas tran epush_c0_cell INTEG V(pwC_c0)   FROM=260.00n TO=286.71n
.meas tran epush_c0_gate INTEG V(pwG_c0)   FROM=260.00n TO=286.71n
.meas tran epush_c0_rec  INTEG V(pwpSA) FROM=288.71n TO=293.71n
.meas tran epull_c0_drv  INTEG V(pwpLC_c0) FROM=292.71n TO=319.41n
.meas tran epull_c0_cell INTEG V(pwC_c0)   FROM=292.71n TO=319.41n
.meas tran epull_c0_gate INTEG V(pwG_c0)   FROM=292.71n TO=319.41n
.meas tran epull_c0_rec  INTEG V(pwpSA) FROM=321.41n TO=326.41n
.meas tran ereset_c0_drv  INTEG V(pwpLC_c0) FROM=325.41n TO=352.12n
.meas tran ereset_c0_cell INTEG V(pwC_c0)   FROM=325.41n TO=352.12n
.meas tran ereset_c0_gate INTEG V(pwG_c0)   FROM=325.41n TO=352.12n
.meas tran ereset_c0_rec  INTEG V(pwpSA) FROM=354.12n TO=359.12n
.meas tran ecyc_c0      INTEG V(pwpLC_c0) FROM=260.00n TO=352.12n
.meas tran line_c0_pk   MAX V(in_c0) FROM=260.00n TO=286.71n
.meas tran line_c0_min  MIN V(in_c0) FROM=292.71n TO=319.41n
.meas tran line_c0_end  FIND V(in_c0) AT=358.12n
.meas tran railA_c0_pk  MAX V(rA_c0) FROM=263.00n TO=286.71n
.meas tran railB_c0_min MIN V(rB_c0) FROM=295.71n TO=319.41n
.meas tran demA_push_c0 FIND V(outA_c0) AT=289.71n
.meas tran demB_push_c0 FIND V(outB_c0) AT=289.71n
.meas tran dA_push_c0   FIND V(vdA_c0)  AT=289.71n
.meas tran dB_push_c0   FIND V(vdB_c0)  AT=289.71n
.meas tran demA_pull_c0 FIND V(outA_c0) AT=322.41n
.meas tran demB_pull_c0 FIND V(outB_c0) AT=322.41n
.meas tran dA_pull_c0   FIND V(vdA_c0)  AT=322.41n
.meas tran dB_pull_c0   FIND V(vdB_c0)  AT=322.41n
.meas tran demA_reset_c0 FIND V(outA_c0) AT=355.12n
.meas tran demB_reset_c0 FIND V(outB_c0) AT=355.12n
.meas tran dA_reset_c0  FIND V(vdA_c0)  AT=355.12n
.meas tran dB_reset_c0  FIND V(vdB_c0)  AT=355.12n
.meas tran ipkP_c0 MIN I(VLCP_c0) FROM=263.00n TO=286.71n
.meas tran ipkN_c0 MAX I(VLCN_c0) FROM=328.41n TO=352.12n
.meas tran didtP_c0 MAX V(didtP_c0) FROM=263.00n TO=286.71n
.meas tran didtN_c0 MAX V(didtN_c0) FROM=328.41n TO=352.12n

* ================= CASE A1: VLC=+-0.36 V, L=40.0u, T/2=20.71n (swing 0.65 V, L=40uH) =================
VLCP_a1 vlcp_a1 0 DC 0.36
VLCN_a1 vlcn_a1 0 DC -0.36
BpLC_a1 pwpLC_a1 0 V = -(V(vlcp_a1)*I(VLCP_a1) + V(vlcn_a1)*I(VLCN_a1))
BdidtP_a1 didtP_a1 0 V = -ddt(I(VLCP_a1))
BdidtN_a1 didtN_a1 0 V =  ddt(I(VLCN_a1))
MPP_a1 a_a1 gPP_a1 vlcp_a1 vlcp_a1 PMOS1 W=60u L=0.18u
VgPP_a1 gPP_a1 0 PWL(0 0.36 420.00n 0.36 423.00n -0.36 443.71n -0.36 446.71n 0.36)
MN0_a1 a_a1 gN0_a1 0 vlcn_a1 NMOS1 W=10u L=0.18u
VgN0_a1 gN0_a1 0 PWL(0 -0.36 452.71n -0.36 455.71n 1.0 476.41n 1.0 479.41n -0.36)
MNN_a1 a_a1 gNN_a1 vlcn_a1 vlcn_a1 NMOS1 W=10u L=0.18u
VgNN_a1 gNN_a1 0 PWL(0 -0.36 485.41n -0.36 488.41n 1.36 509.12n 1.36 512.12n -0.36)
Rbig_a1 a_a1 0 100meg
CAC_a1  a_a1 0 100f
L_a1 a_a1 d_a1 40.00u
Vs_a1 d_a1 in_a1 DC 0
X_a1 in_a1 rA_a1 rB_a1 ternary_cell
BpC_a1 pwC_a1 0 V = V(in_a1)*I(Vs_a1)
BpG_a1 pwG_a1 0 V = V(gPP_a1)*I(VgPP_a1) + V(gN0_a1)*I(VgN0_a1) + V(gNN_a1)*I(VgNN_a1)
Vclk_a1 clk_a1 0 PWL(0 1 448.21n 1 448.71n 0 450.71n 0 451.21n 1 480.91n 1 481.41n 0 483.41n 0 483.91n 1 513.62n 1 514.12n 0 516.12n 0 516.62n 1)
XsaA_a1 0 rA_a1 clk_a1 vddsa outA_a1 outAb_a1 sensamp
XsaB_a1 rB_a1 0 clk_a1 vddsa outB_a1 outBb_a1 sensamp
BdA_a1 vdA_a1 0 V = V(outA_a1)-V(outAb_a1)
BdB_a1 vdB_a1 0 V = V(outB_a1)-V(outBb_a1)

* --- measurements A1 ---
.meas tran epush_a1_drv  INTEG V(pwpLC_a1) FROM=420.00n TO=446.71n
.meas tran epush_a1_cell INTEG V(pwC_a1)   FROM=420.00n TO=446.71n
.meas tran epush_a1_gate INTEG V(pwG_a1)   FROM=420.00n TO=446.71n
.meas tran epush_a1_rec  INTEG V(pwpSA) FROM=448.71n TO=453.71n
.meas tran epull_a1_drv  INTEG V(pwpLC_a1) FROM=452.71n TO=479.41n
.meas tran epull_a1_cell INTEG V(pwC_a1)   FROM=452.71n TO=479.41n
.meas tran epull_a1_gate INTEG V(pwG_a1)   FROM=452.71n TO=479.41n
.meas tran epull_a1_rec  INTEG V(pwpSA) FROM=481.41n TO=486.41n
.meas tran ereset_a1_drv  INTEG V(pwpLC_a1) FROM=485.41n TO=512.12n
.meas tran ereset_a1_cell INTEG V(pwC_a1)   FROM=485.41n TO=512.12n
